## Minimal Go-style heartbeat loop (conceptual)

```go
// Not production code; illustrative only.
func (n *Node) startLeaderLoop() {
    for n.isLeader() {
        for _, peer := range n.peers {
            go func(p *Peer) {
                // send AppendEntries with no entries = heartbeat
                p.AppendEntries(n.currentTerm, n.prevLogIndex, n.prevLogTerm, nil, n.commitIndex)
            }(peer)
        }
        time.Sleep(50 * time.Millisecond) // heartbeat interval
    }
}
```

This demonstrates the simple heartbeats a leader sends. Real implementations handle responses, advance commitIndex when a majority ack, and persist state to disk.
